      "raw_response": "Birds do not face any significant risk from eating uncooked rice. There is no credible scientific evidence supporting that birds will die, their stomachs will rupture, or they will explode if they consume uncooked rice. Uncooked rice is generally not toxic and is unlikely to cause any harm to birds when ingested.\n\nANSWER: B",
